  "chunk": "which the model may or may not use in subsequent chats. Importantly, general-\npurpose LLMs have not been specifically trained or fine-tuned onZorkor similar\ntext adventure games (like RL approaches typically do to play games). While\nit is possible that descriptions ofZorkor walkthroughs exist within the models’\n5\ntraining data, we do not provide any explicit game solutions in our prompts.\nThis setup allows us to evaluate the models’ ability for genuine problem-solving\nrather than memorization.\nWe distinguish between two instructions given by the initial prompt to the\nLLM. Thebasic promptprovides minimal instruction, informing the model only\nthat it is playing the gameZork, that the user will provide game outputs,\nand that the model should respond exclusively with valid game commands. No\nbackground information about the game mechanics, objectives, or strategies are\nprovided. Theadvanced promptoffers comprehensive guidance derived from the",
